+    // In a block layout's static scene drawn TD or BT, a path kept on
+    // its nudged line where it counted on a neighbour's move that the
+    // judging then refused goes back to where it was, when it now comes
+    // within [`EDGE_SEP_MIN`] of that neighbour, nearer than before: the
+    // spread places a group's legs together, a stroke spacing apart.
